<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns first credit.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns first credit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the first of four credits it sought to inject 5.602 billion pesos in the secondary market Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.367 bln  16 days   32.17 pct</p>
<p>    1.368 bln  12 days</p>
<p>    1.367 bln   6 days</p>
<p>    1.500 bln   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559</p>
</text>
